def add(n,k,e,ks,es,ans,ae=None,parts=[]):
 b.add(n,216 if n<=11 else 217 if n<=62 else 218,('최댓값과 최솟값','Maximum and minimum values'),(k,e),list(zip(ks,es)),(ans,ans if ae is None else ae),parts,check=('정의역·열린 끝점·임계수와 후보 함수값을 대조했다. 국소 극값은 교재처럼 정의역 내부의 열린 근방에서 판단한다.','Checked domains, open endpoints, critical numbers and candidate values. Local extrema use an open neighborhood interior to the domain, following the textbook.'));b.E[n]['conceptHref']='../../calc1/index.html'
add(1,'절대최솟값과국소최솟값의차이를설명하라.','Explain the difference between an absolute minimum and a local minimum.',['절대최소는정의역전체의모든x에대해f(c)≤f(x)가성립한다.','국소최소는c를포함한어떤작은열린구간의x들에대해서만같은부등식이성립하면된다. 멀리떨어진곳에서더작은값이있을수있다.'],['An absolute minimum satisfies f(c)≤f(x)for every x in the entire domain.','A local minimum requires the inequality only in some open interval around c. Smaller values may occur farther away.'],'비교범위가정의역전체인지c주변인지를구별한다.','Distinguish comparison over the entire domain from comparison near c.')
add(2,'f가닫힌구간[a,b]에서연속이다. (a)절대최대·최소의존재정리,(b)그값을찾는절차를설명하라.','Let f be continuous on[a,b]. (a)Name the theorem guaranteeing absolute extrema;(b)explain how to find them.',['(a)최댓값·최솟값정리(Extreme Value Theorem).','(b)(a,b)안에서f′=0이거나f′가존재하지않되f는정의되는임계수를모은다. 모든임계수와양끝점a,b에서f값을계산하고가장큰값과가장작은값을고른다.'],['(a)The Extreme Value Theorem.','(b)List interior critical numbers where f′=0 or f′fails to exist while f is defined. Evaluate f there and at a,b, then compare all candidate values.'],'연속성+닫힌유계구간에서극값존재; 내부임계수와끝점의함수값비교.','Continuity on a compact interval guarantees extrema; compare values at interior critical numbers and endpoints.',parts=list('ab'))
for n,kans,eans,why,whye in [(3,'a:해당없음; b:국소최소; c:국소최대; d:해당없음; r:절대·국소최소; s:절대최대.','a:neither; b:local minimum; c:local maximum; d:neither; r:absolute and local minimum; s:absolute maximum.','전체에서가장낮은곳은r,가장높은곳은s이다. 내부에서증감이바뀌는b,c,r을살피고,단조구간위의d와끝점a를구별한다.','The lowest point is r and the highest is s. At interior b,c,r the monotonicity reverses; d lies on a monotone segment and a is an endpoint.'),(4,'a:절대최소; b:국소최대; c:해당없음; d:국소최소; r:절대·국소최대; s:해당없음.','a:absolute minimum; b:local maximum; c:neither; d:local minimum; r:absolute and local maximum; s:neither.','함수값은채운점에서읽는다. b의양쪽가까운값은f(b)보다작다. c에서는왼쪽값은f(c)보다크고오른쪽값은작아극값이아니다.','Read function values from filled points. Both sides near b are below f(b). Near c the left values are larger and the right values smaller, so c is not an extremum.')]:
 add(n,'주어진개형의a,b,c,d,r,s를절대·국소최대/최소또는해당없음으로분류하라.','Classify a,b,c,d,r,s on the supplied graph as absolute/local maxima/minima or neither.',[why,'끝점은이교재의국소극값정의에넣지않는다.'],[whye,'Endpoints are not counted as local extrema under the textbook convention.'],kans,eans)
for n,kans,eans,why,whye in [(5,'절대최대5; 절대최소없음. 국소최대값5,4; 국소최소값3,2.','Absolute maximum5; no absolute minimum. Local maximum values5,4; local minimum values3,2.','최고점은(4,5). 오른쪽끝에서1에다가가지만1은취하지않는다. x=1의채운점은주변보다낮아값3인국소최소이고,x=2에서도값2인국소최소이다. x=5의값3도국소최소이며x=6의채운점값4는국소최대이다.','The top is(4,5). The right branch approaches1 without attaining it. The filled point at x=1 gives local minimum3; x=2 gives local minimum2. The value3 at x=5 is also a local minimum, and the filled value4 at x=6 is a local maximum.'),(6,'절대최대없음; 절대최소1. 국소최대값4,3; 국소최소값2,1.','No absolute maximum; absolute minimum1. Local maximum values4,3; local minimum values2,1.','왼쪽의열린점값5에는다가가기만한다. 채운(2,2)는주변보다낮고(4,1)은전체최저점이다. 봉우리(3,4),(6,3)는국소최대이다.','The open left endpoint approaches5 but never attains it. The filled point(2,2)is below nearby values; (4,1)is globally lowest. Peaks(3,4),(6,3)are local maxima.')]:
 add(n,'그림에서절대최대·최소와국소최대·최소의값을읽어라.','Read the absolute and local maximum and minimum values from the graph.',[why],[whye],kans,eans)
examples={7:([(1,2),(2,0),(3,3),(4,1),(5,4)],'절대최대x=5,절대최소x=2,국소최대x=3,국소최소x=2,4','absolute maximum at5,absolute minimum at2,local maximum at3,local minima at2,4'),8:([(1,1),(2,3),(3,2),(4,4),(5,0)],'절대최대x=4,절대최소x=5,국소최대x=2,국소최소x=3','absolute maximum at4,absolute minimum at5,local maximum at2,local minimum at3'),9:([(1,1),(2,3),(3,0),(4,4),(5,2)],'절대최소x=3,절대최대x=4,국소최대x=2','absolute minimum at3,absolute maximum at4,local maximum at2')}
