eq('14 derivative',s.diff(f14,x)-x*(x*x-1)*(x*x-4)*(x*x-9)**2/1000)
add(14,'(a)국소최대2개·국소최소1개·절대최소없음,(b)국소최소3개·국소최대2개·임계수7개인함수를그려라.','Sketch(a)a function with two local maxima,one local minimum and no absolute minimum;(b)one with three local minima,two local maxima and seven critical numbers.',[m(r'(a)\ f(x)=-(x^2-1)^2'),'x=±1은국소최대,x=0은국소최소이며|x|→∞에서f→−∞이다.',m(r'(b)\ f(x)='+tex(f14)),m(r'f^{\prime}(x)=x(x^2-1)(x^2-4)(x^2-9)^2/1000'),'(b)임계수는−3,−2,−1,0,1,2,3이다. −2,0,2에서는−→+로국소최소,−1,1에서는+→−로국소최대이다. ±3에서는부호가바뀌지않는다.'],[m(r'(a)\ f(x)=-(x^2-1)^2'),'The local maxima occur at±1,the local minimum at0,and f→−∞ as |x|→∞.',m(r'(b)\ f(x)='+tex(f14)),m(r'f^{\prime}(x)=x(x^2-1)(x^2-4)(x^2-9)^2/1000'),'(b)The critical numbers are−3,−2,−1,0,1,2,3. Derivative signs change−to+at−2,0,2(minima),+to−at−1,1(maxima),and do not change at±3.'],'해설의함수와그래프가예이다.','The displayed functions and graphs supply examples.',parts=list('ab'))
