add(70,'셔틀속도자료'+m(r'\begin{array}{c|rrrrrrrr}t(s)&0&10&15&20&32&59&62&125\\v(ft/s)&0&185&319&447&742&1325&1445&4151\end{array}')+'로(a)0≤t≤125의최소제곱3차속도모형을구해그리고(b)가속도모형의최대·최소를추정하라.','Using '+m(r'\begin{array}{c|rrrrrrrr}t(s)&0&10&15&20&32&59&62&125\\v(ft/s)&0&185&319&447&742&1325&1445&4151\end{array}')+', (a)fit and plot a least-squares cubic velocity model on0≤t≤125;(b)find the acceleration model’s extrema.',[m(r'v(t)=c_0+c_1t+c_2t^2+c_3t^3,\quad(X^TX)c=X^Ty'),m(r'(a)\ v(t)\approx'+fdisp),'각자료점의오차제곱합을최소화했다. 절편을0으로고정하지않은회귀이므로모형의v(0)는실제발사속도0과조금다를수있다.',m(r'(b)\ a(t)=v^{\prime}(t)\approx'+adisp),m(rf'a^{{\prime}}(t)=0\Rightarrow t\approx{float(vertex):.4f}'),m(rf'a(0)\approx{float(av[0]):.4f},\quad a({float(vertex):.4f})\approx{float(av[1]):.4f},\quad a(125)\approx{float(av[2]):.4f}')],[m(r'v(t)=c_0+c_1t+c_2t^2+c_3t^3,\quad(X^TX)c=X^Ty'),m(r'(a)\ v(t)\approx'+fdisp),'The fit minimizes the sum of squared residuals. Its intercept was not constrained to zero,so modeled v(0)may differ slightly from the actual launch speed0.',m(r'(b)\ a(t)=v^{\prime}(t)\approx'+adisp),m(rf'a^{{\prime}}(t)=0\Rightarrow t\approx{float(vertex):.4f}'),m(rf'a(0)\approx{float(av[0]):.4f},\quad a({float(vertex):.4f})\approx{float(av[1]):.4f},\quad a(125)\approx{float(av[2]):.4f}')],m(rf'a_{{min}}\approx{float(min(av)):.2f}\,ft/s^2,\quad a_{{max}}\approx{float(max(av)):.2f}\,ft/s^2'),parts=list('ab'))
add(71,'교재의기침유속모형'+m(r'v(r)=k(r_0-r)r^2,\quad r_0/2\le r\le r_0,\quad k,r_0>0')+'에서(a)최대유속의반지름과제시된관찰값2r₀/3을비교하고(b)최대유속,(c)[0,r₀]의그래프를구하라.','For the textbook airflow model '+m(r'v(r)=k(r_0-r)r^2,\quad r_0/2\le r\le r_0,\quad k,r_0>0')+', (a)find the maximizing radius and compare it with the supplied observation2r₀/3;(b)find maximum speed;(c)plot on[0,r₀].',[m(r'v^{\prime}(r)=kr(2r_0-3r)'),'r=2r₀/3전에는증가,뒤에는감소한다. 모형의최대점이문제에서제시한관찰비율과일치한다.',m(r'v(r_0/2)=kr_0^3/8,\quad v(2r_0/3)=4kr_0^3/27,\quad v(r_0)=0'),'(c)무차원변수u=r/r₀를쓰면v/(kr₀³)=u²(1−u)이다. 0에서출발해u=2/3에서정점에이른뒤u=1에서0으로돌아간다.'],[m(r'v^{\prime}(r)=kr(2r_0-3r)'),'The speed increases before2r₀/3 and decreases afterward. The model’s maximizing radius matches the observation supplied in the exercise.',m(r'v(r_0/2)=kr_0^3/8,\quad v(2r_0/3)=4kr_0^3/27,\quad v(r_0)=0'),'(c)With u=r/r₀,the normalized speed is v/(kr₀³)=u²(1−u). It starts at0,peaks at u=2/3 and returns to0 at u=1.'],m(r'r=2r_0/3,\quad v_{max}=4kr_0^3/27'),parts=list('abc'))
add(72,'f(x)=x¹⁰¹+x⁵¹+x+1에국소최대·최소가없음을증명하라.','Prove that f(x)=x¹⁰¹+x⁵¹+x+1 has no local extrema.',[m(r'f^{\prime}(x)=101x^{100}+51x^{50}+1>0\quad\text{for every real }x'),'짝수거듭제곱은음이아니므로도함수는항상양수이다. 모든점의왼쪽에는더작은값,오른쪽에는더큰값이있다.'],[m(r'f^{\prime}(x)=101x^{100}+51x^{50}+1>0\quad\text{for every real }x'),'Even powers are nonnegative,so the derivative is always positive. Every point has smaller values immediately to its left and larger values to its right.'],'엄격히증가하므로국소극값이없다.','Strict increase rules out all local extrema.')
add(73,'(a)f가c에서국소최소이면−f는국소최대임을보이고(b)이것으로국소최소에대한페르마정리를증명하라.','(a)Show that a local minimum of f at c gives a local maximum of−f there;(b)use this to prove Fermat’s theorem for a local minimum.',[m(r'f(c)\le f(x)\Rightarrow-f(c)\ge-f(x)\quad\text{near }c'),'(b)f가c에서미분가능하다고가정한다. g=−f도미분가능하고국소최대이므로이미증명한최대의페르마정리에서g′(c)=0이다.',m(r'g^{\prime}(c)=-f^{\prime}(c)=0\Rightarrow f^{\prime}(c)=0')],[m(r'f(c)\le f(x)\Rightarrow-f(c)\ge-f(x)\quad\text{near }c'),'(b)Assume f is differentiable at c. Then g=−f is differentiable with a local maximum,so the maximum case of Fermat’s theorem gives g′(c)=0.',m(r'g^{\prime}(c)=-f^{\prime}(c)=0\Rightarrow f^{\prime}(c)=0')],m(r'f^{\prime}(c)=0'),parts=list('ab'))
add(74,'3차함수f(x)=ax³+bx²+cx+d(a≠0)에대해(a)임계수가2개·1개·0개인경우를설명하고예와그래프를제시하라. (b)국소극값개수는어떤값이가능한가?','For a cubic f(x)=ax³+bx²+cx+d,a≠0, (a)explain cases with2,1,0 critical numbers and give examples with graphs;(b)state the possible numbers of local extrema.',[m(r'f^{\prime}(x)=3ax^2+2bx+c,\quad\Delta=4(b^2-3ac)'),'Δ>0이면서로다른두실근에서부호가각각바뀌어극대·극소하나씩생긴다. Δ=0이면중근하나이고부호가바뀌지않아극값이없다. Δ<0이면실근도극값도없다.',m(r'x^3-3x:\ c=-1,1;\quad x^3:\ c=0;\quad x^3+x:\ \text{no critical number}')],[m(r'f^{\prime}(x)=3ax^2+2bx+c,\quad\Delta=4(b^2-3ac)'),'If Δ>0,two distinct real roots each change derivative sign,giving one maximum and one minimum. If Δ=0,the single double root does not change sign,so there is no extremum. If Δ<0,there are no real roots or extrema.',m(r'x^3-3x:\ c=-1,1;\quad x^3:\ c=0;\quad x^3+x:\ \text{no critical number}')],'(a)임계수2,1,0개모두가능. (b)국소극값은2개또는0개.','(a)2,1,0 critical numbers are all possible.(b)There can be2 or0 local extrema.',parts=list('ab'))
